  "content": "<p>來試試我的新模組，<strong>維度與地牢！</strong></p><p>點此查看：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensions-and-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensions-and-dungeons</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>我不太喜歡原本狼牙棒看起來像2D貼圖的樣子，覺得如果能做成3D模型會好看很多，所以我就自己動手做了。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>預覽</strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1270471/description_76474dbd-4cd4-4f48-baf7-366c2901a53e.png\" alt=\"狼牙棒預覽\" width=\"205\" height=\"364\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
